WeightXReps Rust client

Usage: wxrust [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list     
  show     
  fetch    
  table    
  heatmap  
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -c, --credentials <CREDENTIALS>  Where to find credentials.txt file
  -a, --force-authentication       Do not use cached auth token
      --no-network                 Not allowed to connect to server
      --no-cache                   Not allosed to read from cache
      --no-cache-write             Not allowed to write to cache
      --color <COLOR>              Color output policy: auto, always, never [default: auto]
  -v, --verbose                    Enable debug output
  -h, --help                       Print help
